WEBVTT

01:40.210 --> 01:45.640
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.440 --> 01:50.710
[Episode 12]

02:03.590 --> 02:04.620
Yitan,

02:04.920 --> 02:06.720
it's time to take your medicine.

02:26.190 --> 02:27.590
The storybook says

02:27.840 --> 02:29.700
mouth-to-mouth feeding will do.

02:55.360 --> 02:56.960
What a ridiculous storybook.

02:56.960 --> 03:00.360
I can't believe I thought I could
feed him medicine like this.

03:04.430 --> 03:05.480
This won't do.

03:05.710 --> 03:08.320
I'll have to try anything at this point.

03:19.190 --> 03:20.340
Yitan,

03:20.560 --> 03:21.400
wake up.

03:31.230 --> 03:33.430
His consciousness is weak, so it's indeed
easier to control.

03:33.430 --> 03:34.060
Good.

03:38.030 --> 03:41.230
Drink all of this medicine without leaving a single drop.

04:19.870 --> 04:21.610
♪ The tall trees are intertwined ♪

04:21.560 --> 04:24.510
I wasn't precise enough in my instructions.

04:22.180 --> 04:23.470
♪ You are so close to me ♪

04:24.050 --> 04:26.770
♪ In the wind and moonlight, my amorous feelings linger ♪

04:25.000 --> 04:26.130
It's not your fault.

04:26.830 --> 04:28.270
It's not your fault. Not your fault.

04:27.450 --> 04:29.340
♪ You gallop on horseback ♪

04:29.660 --> 04:31.270
♪ As if you came as soon as you heard the news ♪

04:31.670 --> 04:34.490
♪ You want to rekindle the stars in my eyes ♪

04:35.060 --> 04:36.820
♪ Through the troubled times filled with beacon fires and chaos ♪

04:37.100 --> 04:38.480
♪ We watch the spring blossoms and autumn fruits ♪

04:37.960 --> 04:39.700
Didn't you say it was just a small wound?

04:39.330 --> 04:42.210
♪ Only you make me feel at ease ♪

04:39.870 --> 04:41.830
Why is it still bleeding?

04:42.760 --> 04:44.630
♪ I want to ♪

04:43.070 --> 04:43.920
Because

04:45.159 --> 04:46.770
♪ Look into your eyes day after day ♪

04:45.510 --> 04:46.880
I was born

04:47.320 --> 04:50.350
♪ But my heartfelt words are hidden behind my lips ♪

04:48.560 --> 04:49.830
unable to clot.

04:50.940 --> 04:53.830
♪ Watching you under the setting sun's afterglow ♪

04:54.350 --> 04:57.440
♪ Is so meaningful and lasting, just like a dream ♪

04:59.040 --> 05:01.400
♪ In that distant light, it's all about ♪

05:02.480 --> 05:04.730
♪ The rest of my life that I'm longing for ♪

05:06.660 --> 05:07.970
The bleeding has finally stopped.

05:06.940 --> 05:08.180
♪ Time slips away ♪

05:09.140 --> 05:11.910
♪ In this life, I'm arrogant and overbearing just for you ♪

05:12.960 --> 05:16.330
♪ I wish that from now on, when the flowers bloom ♪

05:17.530 --> 05:20.520
♪ We are all the same ♪

05:19.050 --> 05:20.710
Yitan, do you still feel cold?

05:22.410 --> 05:23.410
Yes.

05:22.590 --> 05:25.680
♪ Do you know the lovesickness that pierces deep into my bones? ♪

05:26.560 --> 05:29.440
♪ It makes me restrained yet infatuated ♪

05:30.500 --> 05:33.520
♪ Do you know the feeling of gathering the morning flowers in the evening? ♪

05:34.050 --> 05:37.250
♪ It's the most regrettable thing ♪

05:38.159 --> 05:41.330
♪ Do you know that staying together for a lifetime ♪

05:42.040 --> 05:45.010
♪ Is the most beautiful vow I've ever made? ♪

05:45.730 --> 05:47.700
♪ Do you know your name ♪

05:48.430 --> 05:49.680
♪ Is the shortest love poem ♪

05:50.330 --> 05:55.380
♪ I've ever read? ♪

05:58.640 --> 05:59.560
Yitan.

06:00.720 --> 06:03.080
It turns out your palms,
which never touch a sword,

06:01.330 --> 06:04.970
♪ Do you know the lovesickness that pierces deep into my bones? ♪

06:03.360 --> 06:04.560
are also calloused.

06:05.090 --> 06:06.890
Just like mine.

06:05.570 --> 06:08.700
♪ It makes me greedy yet selfless ♪

06:07.360 --> 06:08.820
Block with the sword on the left, and take a step back.

06:08.820 --> 06:09.730
Attack that person's right side.

06:09.440 --> 06:11.130
♪ Do you know the sunset ♪

06:11.760 --> 06:13.120
♪ Is the warmest beginning ♪

06:12.040 --> 06:14.800
Yitan, do you really plan to just talk
and not actually fight?

06:13.760 --> 06:19.180
♪ When I fell in love with you? ♪

06:14.820 --> 06:16.480
Yes, since you're so capable.

06:18.750 --> 06:19.720
So,

06:20.300 --> 06:22.690
this is why you've been holding back.

06:21.060 --> 06:23.260
♪ Do you know the sunset ♪

06:24.010 --> 06:25.340
♪ Is the warmest beginning ♪

06:26.620 --> 06:35.530
♪ When I fell in love with you? ♪

06:48.800 --> 06:49.560
Hongye.

06:49.720 --> 06:51.780
Huaizhu still has so many clothes on.

06:51.920 --> 06:53.680
It's fine to take one off.

06:55.680 --> 06:57.820
With your way of playing,

06:58.000 --> 06:59.310
we're bound to lose.

07:00.240 --> 07:02.310
What's the point of playing like this?

07:02.310 --> 07:03.160
Why don't you

07:03.720 --> 07:04.950
just kill us instead?

07:05.870 --> 07:07.470
Are you trying to provoke me?

07:07.920 --> 07:10.290
If I were to show my real strength,

07:10.360 --> 07:11.760
would you dare to face it?

07:13.040 --> 07:14.230
Why wouldn't I dare?

07:20.390 --> 07:21.920
It's your turn now, Hongye.

07:22.270 --> 07:24.670
Let's bet on who can form hand seals faster.

07:24.680 --> 07:25.960
You're a swordsman,

07:26.310 --> 07:28.440
so you probably aren't very good at it.

07:37.159 --> 07:37.950
Alright.

07:52.360 --> 07:53.120
You lost.

07:55.850 --> 07:56.770
I told you

07:57.120 --> 07:58.450
you could control fire.

08:04.710 --> 08:05.710
You're cheating!

08:05.960 --> 08:07.160
You can cheat,

08:07.480 --> 08:08.980
so why can't we?

08:09.170 --> 08:11.100
I, Jia Lan, have never lost before.

08:11.480 --> 08:13.340
I will poison both of you to death!

08:41.440 --> 08:42.390
So it's you.

08:45.000 --> 08:45.800
Very well.

08:46.250 --> 08:47.510
I'm really satisfied.

08:50.190 --> 08:51.020
Follow me.

08:53.320 --> 08:54.270
Jia Lan.

08:56.270 --> 08:57.630
You've recognized her.

09:00.560 --> 09:01.760
Is it beautiful here?

09:03.270 --> 09:03.960
It is.

09:05.240 --> 09:06.700
Such a perfunctory response.

09:06.700 --> 09:08.510
Are you that eager to leave?

09:09.240 --> 09:10.790
How should we leave?

09:10.810 --> 09:12.700
You only won one round against me.

09:12.790 --> 09:13.720
So,

09:14.120 --> 09:15.520
only one of you can leave.

09:19.770 --> 09:21.430
I will use all my demonic power

09:21.550 --> 09:23.290
to send you to a place.

09:23.520 --> 09:25.030
There, you will...

09:25.510 --> 09:26.440
Kill each other.

09:30.450 --> 09:31.900
Either

09:31.920 --> 09:33.040
you both die,

09:33.670 --> 09:34.920
or

09:34.970 --> 09:37.720
one of you kills the other

09:37.790 --> 09:39.110
and leaves here alive.

09:40.850 --> 09:42.470
Who will be the one

09:43.390 --> 09:44.720
that leaves here alive?

10:02.490 --> 10:03.720
What is this place?

10:04.390 --> 10:05.440
July 7th.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.730
Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai.

10:08.360 --> 10:10.000
This place is very important to

10:10.000 --> 10:11.030
both of us.

10:12.720 --> 10:14.000
So I guess this is

10:15.720 --> 10:17.580
the depths of our consciousness.

10:23.990 --> 10:25.720
Is Dongfang Huaizhu

10:25.840 --> 10:27.750
the one you chose, Lord Jiuhuo?

10:28.000 --> 10:30.960
To be precise, she was chosen by you.

10:31.390 --> 10:32.150
Jia Lan.

10:32.960 --> 10:34.840
Why did you create this illusion?

10:35.440 --> 10:36.840
Do you know that when your

10:36.840 --> 10:39.640
demonic energy is exhausted, you will disappear?

10:39.790 --> 10:41.990
The mandala flower represents hatred.

10:42.240 --> 10:44.720
Although you've cleansed her memory, My Lord,

10:44.720 --> 10:46.650
Dongfang Huaizhu still holds love

10:46.670 --> 10:47.750
in her heart.

10:48.320 --> 10:49.910
You want them to kill their beloved

10:49.910 --> 10:51.760
in the place of

10:52.030 --> 10:53.490
their happiest memories?

10:54.240 --> 10:55.440
Only in this way can

10:55.630 --> 10:59.120
the mandala flower completely occupy her soul.

10:59.750 --> 11:00.800
Only then can she

11:00.870 --> 11:03.510
become a truly worthy vessel.

11:04.790 --> 11:06.990
The Golden Dawn is about to be restored.

11:07.340 --> 11:09.150
Wait for me to break through the Boundary.

11:09.150 --> 11:10.360
Once you break through it,

11:10.360 --> 11:11.960
the true Jia Lan will return.

11:12.270 --> 11:13.950
We will take back everything

11:14.870 --> 11:16.150
that everyone owes us.

11:23.150 --> 11:24.720
Telling stories again?

11:25.080 --> 11:26.480
If it were a story,

11:26.590 --> 11:28.910
how could you have the ability to control fire?

11:28.910 --> 11:30.200
Do you really have no recollection

11:30.200 --> 11:31.600
of that Divine Fire mark?

11:39.250 --> 11:40.790
Between you and me, it doesn't
have to be this way.

11:40.790 --> 11:41.810
Between you and me,

11:41.810 --> 11:43.870
it's destined that only one can live.

12:17.150 --> 12:18.870
If you were willing to kill me,

12:19.240 --> 12:20.700
you would have done it long ago.

12:20.700 --> 12:22.320
But if you use the Divine Fire,

12:22.320 --> 12:23.980
I may not be able to defeat you.

12:24.600 --> 12:25.390
Alright.

12:26.610 --> 12:28.000
Put the sword away,

12:28.580 --> 12:29.840
and let's fight again.

12:35.100 --> 12:36.590
This is the illusion of the heart.

12:36.590 --> 12:37.770
If we die here,

12:38.020 --> 12:40.220
our consciousness will sleep forever.

12:40.910 --> 12:43.910
We'll become living dead, no different from the dead.

12:46.510 --> 12:47.970
Then what's stopping you?

12:48.340 --> 12:50.390
If one of us must die,

12:52.030 --> 12:53.430
that person won't be you.

12:57.270 --> 12:58.320
So,

13:00.000 --> 13:01.790
you're willing to die for me?

13:02.720 --> 13:03.960
I won't die for you.

13:04.550 --> 13:05.750
I want us both to live.

13:06.240 --> 13:07.500
Come with me to a place.

13:18.630 --> 13:19.550
Where is this?

13:24.030 --> 13:25.760
We once watched the sunset here

13:26.690 --> 13:27.910
together.

13:36.970 --> 13:38.630
The sun is setting

13:39.030 --> 13:40.080
so quickly today.

13:42.030 --> 13:43.830
I wish it could last a bit longer.

13:44.750 --> 13:46.610
If you feel the sunset is too short,

13:46.610 --> 13:47.920
next time,

13:49.120 --> 13:50.920
let's watch the stars together.

13:53.320 --> 13:54.080
Sure.

14:14.970 --> 14:15.520
Do you...

14:17.000 --> 14:18.200
Remember something?

14:22.870 --> 14:23.440
I...

14:26.940 --> 14:28.170
Remember now.

14:30.910 --> 14:31.790
What...

14:32.910 --> 14:33.840
Do you remember?

14:38.080 --> 14:39.320
This place is...

14:51.360 --> 14:52.720
I remember now.

14:53.720 --> 14:56.090
This is where you'll be buried.

15:02.270 --> 15:03.120
Remember,

15:05.240 --> 15:07.150
you are Dongfang Huaizhu.

15:08.160 --> 15:10.340
You must not trust Jiuhuo.

15:32.900 --> 15:34.360
Wangquan Hongye.

15:34.690 --> 15:35.970
Lord Jiuhuo.

15:36.970 --> 15:38.310
I don't trust anyone.

15:39.390 --> 15:41.460
I only trust myself.

16:03.130 --> 16:04.440
What will happen to him?

16:04.440 --> 16:07.340
Oh, he was killed by you in the illusion.

16:07.550 --> 16:09.730
He will be forever trapped in the nightmare,

16:09.730 --> 16:11.010
never to wake up again.

16:13.750 --> 16:15.610
What? Are you reluctant to let go?

16:16.990 --> 16:18.070
How could I be?

16:18.750 --> 16:20.290
He's already gone.

16:20.390 --> 16:22.790
In the end, your own life is more important.

16:22.790 --> 16:23.630
Huaizhu.

16:23.750 --> 16:25.180
You should move on.

16:25.270 --> 16:26.510
I've already won.

16:26.710 --> 16:27.900
Can I leave now?

16:30.870 --> 16:34.400
Huaizhu, stay with me a little longer
to enjoy the scenery here.

16:34.480 --> 16:35.790
I'm not a real entity.

16:36.360 --> 16:38.910
I'm just a shadow created by Jia Lan with her

16:38.960 --> 16:41.490
demonic energy when she left Mount Xuankong.

16:41.720 --> 16:43.320
I'm about to dissipate.

16:43.550 --> 16:44.860
Once I'm gone,

16:45.030 --> 16:48.000
the barrier of Mount Xuankong will naturally break.

16:49.850 --> 16:51.850
Just admiring the scenery is no fun.

16:52.390 --> 16:54.070
I'd like to hear the story

16:54.240 --> 16:56.220
between you and Lord Jiuhuo.

16:56.670 --> 16:57.720
Why?

16:57.840 --> 17:00.750
You don't seem like the type to pry, Huaizhu.

17:01.390 --> 17:02.390
Because

17:02.840 --> 17:03.970
we are very similar.

17:04.550 --> 17:06.000
And I want to know

17:06.200 --> 17:09.030
if Lord Jiuhuo is worth following.

17:09.550 --> 17:10.640
Of course he is.

17:11.270 --> 17:13.470
Lord Jiuhuo is the only one in this world

17:13.790 --> 17:15.200
who loves us.

17:16.310 --> 17:17.400
The only one?

17:20.750 --> 17:24.109
Your appearance is quite pleasing.

17:25.160 --> 17:26.369
That's because

17:26.640 --> 17:28.160
I was born evil.

17:28.590 --> 17:30.110
I am the legendary evil fox

17:30.350 --> 17:32.790
born from the resentment

17:33.640 --> 17:35.100
between heaven and earth.

17:36.270 --> 17:37.750
You probably know

17:38.280 --> 17:40.860
there's a huge Grief Tree in Tushan.

17:41.560 --> 17:44.110
The most powerful fox demons in Tushan

17:44.140 --> 17:45.590
are all orphans,

17:45.750 --> 17:47.240
born from the Grief Tree.

17:47.760 --> 17:51.220
It's said that I was different from
other fox demons at birth.

17:51.540 --> 17:53.720
I was completely black.

17:54.040 --> 17:55.440
My demonic energy was extremely strong.

17:55.440 --> 17:57.570
I took human form as soon as I turned 10.

17:57.920 --> 17:58.680
Unlike those

17:58.680 --> 18:00.910
fox demons who like flowers and plants,

18:01.400 --> 18:04.740
I was naturally drawn to darkness and death.

18:05.280 --> 18:06.750
The elders of Tushan

18:06.750 --> 18:08.610
quickly noticed my differences.

18:09.400 --> 18:11.000
They divined my fate

18:11.000 --> 18:12.810
and told my fortune.

18:12.830 --> 18:15.110
They said I was born from the resentment
between heaven and earth,

18:15.110 --> 18:16.880
a born devil,

18:17.030 --> 18:19.150
destined to destroy the world.

18:19.270 --> 18:21.550
So they sent me to

18:21.550 --> 18:24.080
Jiqing Cliff, which is over 300 miles away from Tushan.

18:24.080 --> 18:25.740
They set up a barrier to trap me

18:25.880 --> 18:28.000
and gave me a seed from the Grief Tree.

18:28.830 --> 18:30.070
They lied to me, saying

18:30.070 --> 18:32.220
as long as I could grow a Grief Tree,

18:32.470 --> 18:33.860
I would gain my freedom.

18:34.070 --> 18:35.030
In the end,

18:35.050 --> 18:36.540
with my hatred,

18:36.560 --> 18:39.760
I grew a Black Grief Tree.

18:41.630 --> 18:42.920
My power also grew

18:42.920 --> 18:45.290
along with this giant tree full of hatred.

18:47.000 --> 18:49.220
I waited for them at Jiqing Cliff.

18:49.980 --> 18:52.190
I want them to know that

18:55.200 --> 18:56.790
those who wrong me,

18:56.820 --> 18:59.750
I will repay in kind.

19:01.250 --> 19:03.470
[Jia Lan, juvenile form, fox demon]

19:25.440 --> 19:26.420
Who are you?

19:27.830 --> 19:28.980
These demons...

19:31.260 --> 19:32.860
Were they all killed by you?

19:35.780 --> 19:37.290
Interesting.

19:38.330 --> 19:39.540
However,

19:39.570 --> 19:41.900
many fox demons will come to kill you soon.

19:45.000 --> 19:48.060
I am Jiuhuo, a celestial demon of the Netherworld Clan.

19:48.590 --> 19:49.800
Come with me.

19:54.510 --> 19:57.220
Do you think they deserved to die?

19:57.450 --> 19:58.780
It wasn't unjustified.

19:58.980 --> 20:00.120
How nice.

20:00.780 --> 20:02.800
Besides Lord Jiuhuo,

20:02.880 --> 20:05.540
there's another person who understands me now.

20:06.220 --> 20:08.330
They wanted to imprison me for life.

20:09.090 --> 20:11.200
Why shouldn't I kill them all?

20:13.100 --> 20:16.100
So what happened to you after that?

20:16.240 --> 20:18.890
Why are you only left with a shadow?

20:19.960 --> 20:21.200
Did Lord Jiuhuo

20:21.200 --> 20:24.310
repair the Golden Dawn for your sake?

20:26.690 --> 20:28.690
You've got quite a lot of questions,

20:28.960 --> 20:30.550
but I'm running out of time.

20:31.340 --> 20:33.150
You're about to disappear.

20:33.480 --> 20:36.740
Is Lord Jiuhuo just going to watch without doing anything?

20:39.200 --> 20:40.350
He promised me.

20:41.850 --> 20:43.520
He won't watch me disappear.

20:45.090 --> 20:46.330
We'll meet again.

20:51.390 --> 20:52.460
That's perfect.

20:58.400 --> 21:00.130
Rather than letting you dissipate,

21:00.130 --> 21:02.420
why not give your power to me?

21:14.170 --> 21:15.420
What a pity.

21:16.260 --> 21:18.280
I do like to hear stories,

21:18.750 --> 21:21.270
but I'm never moved by others' tales.

21:47.920 --> 21:50.010
Wangquan Hongye.

21:54.510 --> 21:56.440
The moment you died for me

21:57.070 --> 21:58.800
was actually quite beautiful.

22:23.590 --> 22:24.640
Lord Jiuhuo.

22:25.980 --> 22:27.200
What's going on?

22:27.890 --> 22:31.280
A piece of the Golden Dawn is still missing.

22:32.230 --> 22:33.430
It's all my fault.

22:33.640 --> 22:35.900
A leech demon that I've been cultivating
for a long time

22:35.900 --> 22:38.360
somehow retained its consciousness

22:38.430 --> 22:40.490
and escaped from the Golden Dawn Inn.

22:40.600 --> 22:42.420
Such a major incident occurred,

22:42.510 --> 22:43.980
and you're only telling me now?

22:43.980 --> 22:47.460
The Seven-Star Alignment will end in seven days.

22:47.490 --> 22:48.850
Please don't worry, My Lord.

22:48.850 --> 22:50.590
I've sent people to search the entire city.

22:50.590 --> 22:51.920
We'll find it in no time.

22:58.250 --> 22:59.480
If you can't find it,

22:59.650 --> 23:01.870
I'll use you as a replacement.

23:02.750 --> 23:03.550
Yes, My Lord.

23:10.090 --> 23:11.980
Has the Left Guardian returned?

23:12.300 --> 23:13.510
Yes, he has.

23:13.640 --> 23:14.570
He's in his room.

23:39.520 --> 23:41.790
[Cuiyu Mingluan, Elder of the Leech Clan]

23:53.680 --> 23:54.270
Who is it?

24:33.230 --> 24:34.950
[Mu Mie, Mu Xiaowu's son]

24:35.070 --> 24:36.720
Excuse me, Miss...

24:43.450 --> 24:44.080
Miss.

24:45.020 --> 24:45.660
Miss?

24:49.590 --> 24:51.400
Miss, I mean no harm.

24:51.960 --> 24:53.400
I apologize for startling you earlier, Miss.

24:53.400 --> 24:54.680
I'm truly sorry.

24:54.870 --> 24:57.260
I just wanted to ask for directions.

24:59.030 --> 24:59.830
Miss!

25:12.830 --> 25:14.160
The Eye of Water Spirit?

25:14.570 --> 25:15.410
Miss,

25:15.970 --> 25:17.310
are you a healer from the demon realm?

25:17.310 --> 25:18.570
The Leech Clan, right?

25:19.200 --> 25:20.060
Clairvoyance?

25:23.070 --> 25:24.000
Sir,

25:25.200 --> 25:26.460
where are you heading?

25:27.550 --> 25:29.220
Miss, I hope you wouldn't mind telling me

25:29.220 --> 25:31.630
how to get to the Golden Dawn Inn.

25:36.440 --> 25:38.480
Miss, what's wrong?

25:39.780 --> 25:41.680
Why do you want to go to the Golden Dawn Inn?

25:41.680 --> 25:43.910
Is it absolutely necessary for you to go there?

25:43.910 --> 25:45.570
Because there are some things

25:45.820 --> 25:47.650
I must go there to figure out.

25:48.480 --> 25:51.340
So I hope you can kindly give me some guidance, Miss.

25:55.120 --> 25:57.280
Go 1.6 miles north from here,

25:57.510 --> 25:59.080
then 3.3 miles west,

25:59.190 --> 26:01.030
then walk north past a village,

26:01.050 --> 26:02.640
then 3.3 miles east, and you'll...

26:02.640 --> 26:03.480
Miss,

26:04.170 --> 26:06.370
could you slow down a bit?

26:06.440 --> 26:08.970
Then walk 3.3 miles east, and you'll be there.

26:13.790 --> 26:14.640
Thank you.

26:20.410 --> 26:22.070
Why did she leave so suddenly?

26:26.490 --> 26:28.080
Still, thank you, Miss.

26:37.460 --> 26:38.910
You must remember,

26:39.630 --> 26:41.570
you are Dongfang Huaizhu.

26:42.140 --> 26:43.190
You must

26:44.260 --> 26:46.540
not believe Jiuhuo.

26:57.050 --> 26:59.030
Why is my demonic aura

26:59.030 --> 27:00.690
exactly the same as Jia Lan's?

27:09.720 --> 27:10.630
Very well.

27:11.000 --> 27:12.310
I'm really satisfied.

27:14.150 --> 27:15.960
Who exactly is Jia Lan?

27:16.980 --> 27:18.270
Why was she satisfied?

27:20.870 --> 27:22.160
Now that you're back,

27:22.440 --> 27:24.040
why didn't you come to see me?

27:24.480 --> 27:25.510
Are you angry at me

27:25.510 --> 27:26.960
for not rescuing you from the barrier

27:26.960 --> 27:28.020
of Mount Xuankong?

27:29.270 --> 27:30.340
How could I be?

27:31.030 --> 27:33.160
You just trust me, My Lord, that's all.

27:33.520 --> 27:34.880
And there, My Lord,

27:34.900 --> 27:36.860
I met your former disciple,

27:37.510 --> 27:38.270
Jia Lan.

27:39.310 --> 27:40.680
That was just a shadow.

27:42.960 --> 27:44.880
But the demonic aura in my body

27:44.900 --> 27:47.720
clearly comes from the same source as Jia Lan's shadow.

27:47.720 --> 27:50.520
Don't you think you owe me an explanation, My Lord?

27:53.540 --> 27:55.580
Back in the chaotic times of human-demon conflict,

27:55.580 --> 27:57.040
when I found you,

27:57.070 --> 27:58.790
you were already on the brink of death.

27:58.790 --> 28:01.750
I injected Jia Lan's demonic energy into your body.

28:02.590 --> 28:04.310
However, her demonic aura was too strong.

28:04.310 --> 28:06.560
After you regained your demonic energy,

28:06.560 --> 28:08.190
you forgot your past.

28:08.440 --> 28:11.090
So what was my identity before
I lost my memory?

28:11.990 --> 28:15.600
Is it possible...
That I did know Wangquan Hongye?

28:19.790 --> 28:21.110
I don't know about that.

28:21.110 --> 28:21.960
However,

28:22.020 --> 28:24.420
humans have always coveted demonic power,

28:24.780 --> 28:26.780
wanting to tame and control demons.

28:26.840 --> 28:28.040
They are full of lies.

28:29.510 --> 28:30.920
You should know this.

28:32.000 --> 28:34.130
Of course, I won't easily believe him.

28:34.400 --> 28:35.440
It's just...

28:37.550 --> 28:38.510
Just what?

28:41.330 --> 28:43.190
Your power is boundless, My Lord.

28:43.350 --> 28:46.480
The time you spent with Jia Lan must have
been very happy.

28:46.750 --> 28:49.590
I'm curious about the story between you two.

28:52.170 --> 28:54.100
After I took Jia Lan as my disciple,

28:54.340 --> 28:57.390
the Dragon Clan and the Tushan Clan joined forces to attack me.

28:57.390 --> 28:58.910
During one battle,

28:59.460 --> 29:01.720
my demon core got completely destroyed.

29:02.020 --> 29:03.020
But she,

29:03.050 --> 29:04.720
single-handedly,

29:04.740 --> 29:06.340
slayed dragons for me.

29:08.120 --> 29:10.100
[Dragon Emperor of the True Dragon Clan]

29:12.420 --> 29:14.180
What kind of wild demon are you?

29:13.680 --> 29:15.540
[Jia Lan, fox demon]

29:14.560 --> 29:16.970
What grudge do you have against me?

29:53.950 --> 29:55.820
She brought back the dragon core

29:56.080 --> 29:58.650
and used it to restore my demonic energy.

29:58.850 --> 30:00.610
From that day on,

30:00.640 --> 30:02.390
we both realized

30:02.750 --> 30:05.010
we were each other's only one.

30:05.480 --> 30:06.790
But the good times didn't last long.

30:06.790 --> 30:08.110
500 years ago,

30:08.130 --> 30:10.960
Jia Lan's dark demonic power that could
command other demons

30:10.960 --> 30:13.620
caught the eye of the ruler
of the Beast Kingdom.

30:13.930 --> 30:15.240
They set a trap,

30:15.260 --> 30:17.080
injured and captured me.

30:17.590 --> 30:19.140
To save me, Jia Lan

30:19.890 --> 30:22.310
went to the Beast Kingdom dungeon alone.

30:25.610 --> 30:28.220
500 years ago, at the Beast Kingdom dungeon,

30:28.690 --> 30:30.080
what exactly happened between you

30:30.080 --> 30:31.480
and Jia Lan, My Lord?

30:34.130 --> 30:35.300
Jia Lan!

30:36.150 --> 30:37.280
This memory

30:37.300 --> 30:40.140
is something I never want to recount.

30:41.720 --> 30:44.190
Anyway, everything I'm doing now

30:44.220 --> 30:46.460
is to bring Jia Lan back.

30:48.300 --> 30:50.250
My Lord, so you mean

30:50.330 --> 30:51.690
Jia Lan is still alive?

30:51.950 --> 30:52.640
Of course.

30:53.810 --> 30:55.940
But she's blocked beyond the Boundary

30:56.150 --> 30:57.350
and can't come in yet.

30:57.510 --> 30:58.810
What a pity.

30:58.940 --> 31:00.300
I'm not Jia Lan,

31:00.550 --> 31:02.150
and I can't help you, My Lord.

31:02.380 --> 31:03.440
It doesn't matter.

31:03.620 --> 31:04.820
Jia Lan is Jia Lan,

31:05.000 --> 31:05.860
and you are you.

31:06.270 --> 31:08.570
You only need to be yourself.

31:08.880 --> 31:11.110
Don't think too much about anything else.

31:11.110 --> 31:13.030
As for that Wangquan Hongye...

31:13.110 --> 31:14.510
He's already dead.

31:15.470 --> 31:17.070
He was just a man who extracted
demon cores to forge swords,

31:17.070 --> 31:19.600
a bloodstained human from the Yiqi Alliance.

31:20.050 --> 31:22.370
All he wanted was my demonic power.

31:22.960 --> 31:24.160
His death is no loss.

31:29.440 --> 31:30.920
This is all in the past.

31:31.680 --> 31:33.940
You don't have to think about it anymore.

31:34.910 --> 31:35.950
Yes.

31:36.770 --> 31:38.160
My Lord Jiuhuo.
